Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:40:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1390/1463] HERESY 1432: the page's small things from Viktor's
 screenshots
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- The Artist: the Fine-tune field gone for good (a .field rule beat its hidden attribute, and the check read the attribute, not the screen); The Artist's brushes say Base weights or Fine-tune first; Variations is Batch.
- ▶ Play this song: a filled icon two icons wide in the take's row of icons; Save style and Delete as icons.
- The takes' ⋯ menu wide enough for its words on one line, every item on one indent; a menu with no room under it opens upwards.
- The lyrics' «[» list never scrolls sideways; the MP3 bitrate drawn as the buttons beside it; the bar's ☰ 360 px, MODEL whole; its «Theme» a word the page translates.
- A folded takes list opens over the take while the mouse rests on its strip and folds a second after the mouse leaves; its Fold button then keeps it open.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
